ates looked devine, but they were pricey. Maybe next time I will try one."},{"business_id":"foFm7dh9TpppQ7oQkB5R2w","review_id":"2tmziK81AUoXHtffUS94SQ","date":"2014-03-09T19:23:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9129064083099365,"text_excerpt":"Just stopped in on a chocolate tour. Great gelato and fancy chocolate. The people were nice and friendly. There's even a cigar bar next door that plays Cuban music.... Great addition!"},{"business_id":"foFm7dh9TpppQ7oQkB5R2w","review_id":"TYaFmMi1K45eXnc1vE6IYw","date":"2013-01-26T05:52:55","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9110205769538879,"text_excerpt":"We stopped in and tried the chocolate and cookies and cream gelatos. The chocolate is amazing and rich and my husband liked the cookies and cream so much we went back the next day for more. The second day I had the king cake gelato and that was also very good."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"foFm7dh9TpppQ7oQkB5R2w","photo_id":"eR0VYygXwi-cVqqQJVR_wA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/eR0VYygXwi-cVqqQJVR_wA.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
